-    $$
-    Losses $L_{depth}^{masked}$, $L_{rec}^{masked}$, and $L_{do}$ are computed every $N_{depth}$, $N_{bilateral}$, and $N_{do}$ iterations respectively [S1]. Optimize $\theta$ using gradient descent (e.g., Adam) [Parent].
